@startuml
title Nexo diagram generation workflow
actor Contributor
participant "PlantUML generator" as Generator
participant "PlantUML JAR" as PlantUML
participant "Documentation SVGs" as SVGs
Contributor -> Generator: Run generator after editing .puml sources
Generator -> Generator: Verify pinned JAR checksum
loop Each source
    Generator -> PlantUML: Render into temporary staging directory
    PlantUML --> Generator: SVG or error
end
alt Every source rendered successfully
    Generator -> SVGs: Publish SVGs and remove owned stale outputs
    Generator --> Contributor: Success
else Rendering failed
    Generator --> Contributor: Error; existing SVGs preserved
end
@enduml
